---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title='态度 · Stance · wo/men in tech'
  description='women in tech · 在杭州，慢慢走，慢慢做。不赶，不慌，以自己的节奏做值得署名的事。'
  width='reading'
>
  <article class='ethos'>
    <header class='ethos-head'>
      <span class='eyebrow'>STANCE</span>
      <h1 lang='zh-CN' class='lang-zh'>态度</h1>
      <h1 lang='en' class='lang-en'>Stance</h1>
      <p class='value'>
        <span lang='zh-CN' class='lang-zh'>在杭州的巷子和山径之间，慢慢走，慢慢做。不赶，不慌，以自己的节奏做值得署名的事。<br />这是 women in tech。</span>
        <span lang='en' class='lang-en'>Between Hangzhou's alleys and hill trails, walking slowly, making slowly. No rush, no haste—signable work at our own pace.<br />This is women in tech.</span>
      </p>
    </header>

    <span class='rule' aria-hidden='true'></span>

    <section class='manifesto'>
      <div lang='zh-CN' class='lang-zh'>
        <p>工作之外，<br />总有些事是做给自己的——走走巷子，写写小店，做做器物。</p>
        <p>这里是那个地方。</p>
      </div>
      <div lang='en' class='lang-en'>
        <p>Beyond the day job,<br />there's always something we make for ourselves—alleys, small shops, things shaped by hand.</p>
        <p>This is that place.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <span class='rule' aria-hidden='true'></span>

    <section class='who'>
      <span class='eyebrow'>
        <span lang='zh-CN' class='lang-zh'>面向群体</span>
        <span lang='en' class='lang-en'>Crafted For</span>
      </span>
      <div lang='zh-CN' class='lang-zh'>
        <p>所有以个体之名做事的女性——手艺人、设计师、工程师、艺术工作者、工作室主、写作者……</p>
        <p class='quiet'>不赶，不慌，<br />对正在做的事有一点耐心。</p>
      </div>
      <div lang='en' class='lang-en'>
        <p>All women building under their own names—artisans, designers, engineers, artists, studio owners, writers…</p>
        <p class='quiet'>No rush, no haste,<br />just a little patience for the work at hand.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <span class='rule' aria-hidden='true'></span>

    <section class='principles'>
      <p lang='zh-CN' class='lang-zh'>真诚平等 · 低压倾听 · 保护留白 · 慢工署名</p>
      <p lang='en' class='lang-en'>Grounded · Low-pressure · White space · Authored craft</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .ethos {
    max-width: 34rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--spacing-20) 0 var(--spacing-24);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-8);
  }

  .ethos-head { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: var(--spacing-3); }
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--color-gold-dust);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .ethos-head h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-3xl);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-light);
    color: var(--color-text-heading);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .value {
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-base);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-normal);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: var(--spacing-2) 0 0;
    max-width: 30rem;
  }

  .rule {
    display: block;
    width: var(--spacing-8);
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-gold-dust);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .manifesto p,
  .who p {
    font-family: var(--font-family-body);
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.85;
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-3);
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }
  .manifesto p:last-child,
  .who p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .manifesto p:last-child,
  .who p.quiet { color: var(--color-text-tertiary); font-size: 13.5px; }

  .who { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: var(--spacing-3); }
  .who .eyebrow { color: var(--color-text-tertiary); }

  .principles p {
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ethos-nav { display: flex; gap: var(--spacing-5); margin-top: var(--spacing-2); }
  .ethos-nav a {
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    text-decoration: none !important;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-divider) !important;
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    transition: border-color var(--transition-fast);
  }
  .ethos-nav a:hover { border-bottom-color: var(--color-gold-dust) !important; }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .ethos { padding: var(--spacing-16) 0 var(--spacing-20); gap: var(--spacing-6); }
    .ethos-head h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; }
    .value { font-size: 14px; }
  }
</style>
